  "description": {
   "en": "Mokuhan (woodblock printed) manga.\n\n\"To me, vanishing was eternal release.\"\n\nA man who left his father's house lost interest in studying, lost faith in humanity and locked himself in his apartment. So a year passed alone.\n\nEvery day he thought more and more often about suicide, but one day he looked in the mirror and was stunned: instead of a head he now had a wardobe. His existence became like a wardobe - small and closed from the whole world."
  },
